<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Estee Lauder upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Estee Lauder upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities confirmed analyst Heather Kay upgraded Estee Lauder Cos Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Price target is $55 per share.</p>
<p>-- Cited &quot;currently favorable valuation levels&quot; and &quot;continued dominance of the prestige cosmetic market.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 45-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
